    "answer": {
      "short": "Possible, but impractical: it requires $278$ dots. A frequency table or column graph is easier to read and draw.",
      "worked": "One dot per observation would require $19+21+45+105+88=278$ dots, including a stack of $105$ at the value 8. A dot plot is possible, but cumbersome to draw by hand. A frequency table or column graph is more practical.",
